*.dbmdl
Generated_Code #added for RIA/Silverlight projects

# Backup & report files from converting an old project file to a newer
# Visual Studio version. Backup files are not needed, because we have git ;-)
_UpgradeReport_Files/
Backup*/
UpgradeLog*.XML
/*/AO.Core.XML
/OmniCell/Built
OmniCell/_dotMemory.OmniCell/
OmniCell/OmniCell.sln.DotSettings

# Visual Studio per user state.
.vs/

# Codex left a build tree here on 2026-09-11 and a git add -A swept 28MB of it
# into two commits. The sources it builds are all in Tools/Capture.
.codex-build/

# Python leaves these beside the capture tools
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The operator's real settings - database password, the address players
# connect to. Read in preference to Config.xml when present. See
# configure-server.bat and Documentation/Running-a-server.md.
#
# This exists because the tracked Config.xml held a live database password in
# the working copy for weeks, kept out of commits only by a skip-worktree bit
# that no clone would have inherited.
Config.local.xml

# Each person's own data folders (captures, client install). The template
# paths.example.cfg is tracked; the filled-in copy never is. See SETUP.md.
/paths.cfg

# Working notes handed between development sessions. Kept locally, not part of
# the shared repository.
/OmniCell/Documentation/Handoff.md
/OmniCell/Documentation/HANDOFF-*.md

# Build output under Tools, which the root rules only anchored for OmniCell/.
Built/

# NuGet's command-line tool is Microsoft's, not ours. The launcher's old-style project downloads
# it into its .nuget/ folder on the first build (DownloadNuGetExe is true), so it is not kept here.
**/.nuget/NuGet.exe

# Raw Anarchy Online client files are never committed: the resource database
# (ResourceDatabase.dat, .dat.NNN, .idx) and anything else copied out of a
# client install, and the extractor's intermediate caches built from them.
#
# What the extractor converts into OmniCell's own formats IS tracked, so a
# clone runs without reading a client first: the content packs
# OmniCell/Datafiles/*.ocp and SqlTables/itemnames.sql.
ResourceDatabase.*
/OmniCell/Datafiles/*.dat
/OmniCell/Datafiles/itemrelations.txt
